<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">ENGLISH FLASHCARD</view><view class="hero-title">每天进步一点点</view><view class="hero-sub">用语境记单词，用间隔重复留住记忆。</view><view class="stats"><view class="stat"><text class="stat-num">{{dueCount}}</text><text class="stat-label">今日待复习</text></view><view class="stat"><text class="stat-num">{{totalCount}}</text><text class="stat-label">词库总量</text></view><view class="stat"><text class="stat-num">{{masteredCount}}</text><text class="stat-label">已复习</text></view></view></view><view class="section-title">今日任务</view><view class="card task-card"><view class="task-head"><text class="task-title">到期词汇</text><text class="muted">{{dueCount}} 个单词或短语</text></view><view class="progress"><view class="progress-inner" style="width:{{progress}}%"></view></view><view class="muted task-hint">复习顺序：第 1、2、4、7、15、30、60 天</view><button class="primary start-btn" bindtap="startReview" disabled="{{dueCount===0}}">{{dueCount===0?'今天已完成':'开始今日复习'}}</button></view><view class="section-title">学习原则</view><view class="card principle"><view class="principle-title">先看英文，主动回忆</view><view class="muted">正面只显示英文词汇和英文例句。想好答案后翻面，再查看中文释义、同义词和用法提示。</view></view><view class="footer muted">学习数据保存在本机 · 当前版本无需注册</view></view>